	(text "PA_EN high (3.3 V, CM5 GPIO22) = transmit.  PA_SHDN = GRF5613 VSHDN, high = OFF.  OFF level: 18 kOhm into VSHDN I-V (DS p.4) -> 2.38 V > 1.8 V.  ON: Q1 sinks 0.28 mA."
